      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment reconciled independently by Codex. GMR wording is verbatim; no hgm_gloss promotion. The three source negatives share one English never...either...or construction: the negative-ripening phrase is retained, while the two color negatives remain unbanked with their distributed scope recorded. Zag med has unique stain and negative members within unstained. The causative is discontinuous in English: byed pa owns brings and the complete terminative zad par phrase owns to an end. Quoted it and the explanatory black refer to the same black deed. The following numbered selection heading remains unchanged apparatus."
